                "reviews": [
                    {
                        "recommendationid": "93529127",
                        "author": {
                            "steamid": "76561198036076160",
                            "num_reviews": 18,
                            "playtime_forever": 31,
                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 13,
                            "last_played": 1626983918
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I love Nun imagery, i like nunsploitation films, and im old enough to have played games like this in my childhood so this game has a sweet spot for me.\n\nWhat do you get?:\n- Retro-gaming\n- Cool/avg Music, not super good but enjoyable.\n- You are a badass nun, sadly games dont let you play as them as much as i'd want.\n- Good difficulty, you have a couple of settings, its not super easy but also not super hard (dont know in the harder options)\n- Your enemies are jokes, like gay people throwing rainbows or a nude nun, that's fun (unless it offends you, in this case this game might not be for you)\n\nIt cost me cheaper than a can of pepsi, and it last longer.",
